\newlabel{fig:error}{{10}{10}{Error analysis showing best and worst-case detection for normal and defective samples. Top row: original images. Bottom row: ensemble anomaly heatmap overlay (jet colormap). Even the hardest defect sample produces a detectable heatmap signal, confirming the sensitivity of the ensemble approach}{figure.caption.13}{}}
